{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6577e07d8cda7007dba2a084b4e03fff1ae260eba700443ac26756b72fd8203f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61558dc7eb9035ff3792ef643f86ae1d53c8731328887fcd1848051931aefa91",
      "text": "抽签的结果是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab11cfb33245ceec1b91f34b33b3fb44dce553a6967caeb4fcf9b7db9b9755ec",
      "text": "新年快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9320c05d82f90a2877ba9683e1640768e2d63991fd37b26a691db92d3b9421f3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n新年快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2324e4bd7b595d24588eec55706c650efef12ea80b9769bc46425bd0850c0b0",
      "text": "…新年快乐，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c61c7677867b4a34b9cac92d87a91a7ec03e6d2c9af501c015ee94128c7cb7",
      "text": "新年快乐，\n●●●●●●●●●●Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2e576ec1d06d74ee06eb18eb6797a7fb34612a645776df7784da22211b3cc1d",
      "text": "听各位说今天要去新年参拜呢。怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3493f1f7504714123253ad1a804ab858f7e6697894982e3ff04bd9f2b8a8a33e",
      "text": "噢！来这里之前我们三个一起去参拜了哦！\n还抽了签，占卜了新一年的运势。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e7addaa848fc533fcdecdffb2dea5192cf0df1534e0de8b02361e48662d2316",
      "text": "大家的结果都很好哦！\n抽到的签文让人觉得今年一年大家也要一起加油呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e76534e8683322e667b7a77ba0393c3bb3eacf70bad885341242100a3577545",
      "text": "…之后，他们还陪我去了书店。\n多亏他们，我买到了想要的书。…谢谢你们两个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d118eb966c1e113cba381205bb0baffbb7b26e093c4800e90666d8983a70af7",
      "text": "我们才要谢谢你呢！一希先生推荐给我的书，\n读完之后请一定听听我的感想哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1b5c871b529bbcd63080b41accebd905006b31438f8d886b1db04576f379cb6",
      "text": "…当然可以。那么，既然制作人也\n到了，我们就开始课程吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5040db8985ac3b1ec83ee78ff62b18f972acd7113799443ef27ddf828127051",
      "text": "好的，新年的第一项工作一起加油吧。\n制作人，今年也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_014_23_5_00_014_23:5_00_014_23:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3970db4c73bacb10c01f87c468c5ceda75057074fb32dd3441d1c9a384f9e5ac",
      "text": "多多拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
